    <main id = "main-content" role="main">
        <div class = "container">
            <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
                <h2 id = "about-heading">Bio</h2>
                <div class="about-content">
                    <p style="text-indent: 1rem;">My name is <strong>Owen Espitia</strong>. I grew up in California but moved to Utah a long time ago. I am very passionate about my hobbies and I spend most of my time away from my house pursuing them. I am a firm believer in karma. I love all forms of art and Nujabes is my favorite Artist!</p>
                    <p style="text-indent: 1rem;">I came to Neumont because I believe they do things differently than a normal college. I have really enjoyed my time here with the new friends I've made. Furthermore, I feel that living in SLC has shown me so many different cultures I never would have been apart of otherwise!</p>
                    
                </div>

            </section>
        </div>

    </main>
